    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105405" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐχ-ίας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one
				that is hairy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.148
			</span></i> sq. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a smaller kind of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχίς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				598b12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Mnesim.
				4.38
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Dorio
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.328e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> an unlucky
			throw of the dice, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.204
			</span></i>.</div>
